    <verse name="v2">
      <lines>
      <chord name="D"/>The watchers <chord name="A"/>on the <chord name="Bm"/>mountain proclaim <chord name="D"/>the Bride-groom near.<br/>
      <chord name="Em7"/>Go, meet Him <chord name="A7"/>as He cometh, <chord name="D"/>with hallelujahs clear.<br/>
