    <verse name="v4">
      <lines>
      <chord name="D"/>Our hope <chord name="A"/>and expectation, <chord name="Bm"/>O Jesus, <chord name="D"/>now appear;<br/>
      <chord name="Em7"/>Arise, O sun <chord name="A7"/>so longed for, <chord name="D"/>o&#x27;er this benighted sphere!<br/>
